      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "endpoint",
      "stage": "nntp_fsm",
      "description": "However, if an implementation receives an article from elsewhere that uses octets in the range 128 to 255 in some other manner, it MAY pass it to a client or server without modification.",
